                                "sense_id": "262f297d-a49e-3e33-8e8f-c31476dbdfce",
                                "text": "Femme plutôt sur son quant-à-soi, en tout cas avec la gent masculine, elle fut surprise elle-même par l'audace de son geste, mais la stupéfaction du Chinois la surprit encore davantage.",
                                "translation": "Being quite a self-possessed woman, with male company in any case, she herself was surprised by the audacity of her gesture, but the amazement of the chinaman surprised her even more.",
